# PROGRAM 2 detect: is one feed model object an advertisement
#
# Hand written Brainfuck in the house style of text dot bf: comments never
# hold a command character; @cell checkpoints and tilde run lengths are
# checked by tools/bftool/lint
#
# Port of ReflectiveAdDetector inspect from 1 2 1: each request inspects one
# object and inspects its children by CALLing this program one level deeper
# so recursion depth is the runtime level depth; the host only reads objects
#
# OP 55 DETECT: handle u32; depth; budget u16; descriptor known; then the
# descriptor as CAP NODE answers it when known; answers found and budget
# OP 57 CLASS FACTS: handle u32; answers the packed facts
#
# Class facts from bit 0 up: known; app model class; strong ad class token;
# Pando tree with a JSON accessor; structured toString; memoized per class
#
# Limits: depth 8; budget 1200 inspections per traversal; 32 entries per map
# collection or array; 64 superclasses; text of at most 262144 chars
#
# Every if in this program copies its subject into a temp flag t and runs
# the body once while the flag is set; an else keeps a second flag; numbers
# are little endian and compare from the high byte down
#
# Cells
#
# %cell maj 0
# %cell min 1
# %cell op 2
# %cell flg 3
# %cell len 4 2
# %cell id 6 2
# %cell st 8
